<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
<section id="Ax1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix">Appendix</h2>

<div id="Ax1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ax1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This appendix is organized as follows: Section <a href="#A1" title="Appendix A Useful results ‣ 𝛼-LoRA: Effective Fine-Tuning via Base Model Rescaling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A</span></a> lists some useful lemmas that will be at the core of our analysis. In Section <a href="#A2" title="Appendix B RMT Analysis of the fine-tuned classifier ‣ 𝛼-LoRA: Effective Fine-Tuning via Base Model Rescaling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B</span></a>, we provide a proof of Theorem <a href="#S4.Thmtheorem2" title="Theorem 4.2 (Gaussianity of the fine-tuned Ridge model). ‣ 4 Main results ‣ 𝛼-LoRA: Effective Fine-Tuning via Base Model Rescaling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.2</span></a> using Random Matrix Theory. Section <a href="#A3" title="Appendix C RMT Analysis of the fine-tuned classifier: the case of random source vector ‣ 𝛼-LoRA: Effective Fine-Tuning via Base Model Rescaling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C</span></a> extends the theory to the case of an arbitrary source classifier (not necessarily Ridge) which will be useful also for another extension of the theory to multi-source fine-tuning <a href="#A4" title="Appendix D Extension to multi-source classifiers ‣ 𝛼-LoRA: Effective Fine-Tuning via Base Model Rescaling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">D</span></a>. Finally, <a href="#A5" title="Appendix E LLMs Experimental details ‣ 𝛼-LoRA: Effective Fine-Tuning via Base Model Rescaling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E</span></a> lists the details about our experiments on LLM fine-tuning.</p>
</div>
<div id="Ax1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ax1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Contents</span></p>
</div>
<div id="Ax1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ax1.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Throughout the whole Appendix, we will try to analyze the performance of the fine-tuned classifier defined in equation <a href="#S3.Ex3" title="In Fine-tuning phase. ‣ 3.1 Theoretical Setting ‣ 3 Problem setting and Background ‣ 𝛼-LoRA: Effective Fine-Tuning via Base Model Rescaling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">
                  
                    α
                  
                -FTC</span></a>:</p>
<table id="Ax1.Ex22" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Ax1.Ex22.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{w}}_{\alpha}={\bm{w}}+\alpha\tilde{\bm{w}}-\frac{\alpha}{n}{\mathbf{Q}}(\gamma){\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}\tilde{\bm{w}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝒘</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝒘</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒘</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mi>α</mi><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒘</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{w}}_{\alpha}={\bm{w}}+\alpha\tilde{\bm{w}}-\frac{\alpha}{n}{\mathbf{Q}}(\gamma){\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}\tilde{\bm{w}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<section id="Ax1.SS0.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Notations.</h4>

<div id="Ax1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ax1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Here are two notations that we will use along the whole analysis:</p>
<table id="Ax1.E11" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Ax1.E11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda_{Q}=\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q}),\quad\lambda_{R}=\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}+1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R})" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda_{Q}=\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q}),\quad\lambda_{R}=\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}+1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(11)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Useful results</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>General lemmas</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Here we will list useful lemmas used in our analysis.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem1" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma A.1</span></span><span id="A1.Thmtheorem1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span>(Resolvent identity)<span id="A1.Thmtheorem1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">For invertible matrices <math id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{A}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐀</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{A}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{B}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐁</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{B}}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have:</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex23" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex23.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{A}}^{-1}-{\mathbf{B}}^{-1}={\mathbf{A}}^{-1}({\mathbf{B}}-{\mathbf{A}}){\mathbf{B}}^{-1}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>𝐀</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>𝐁</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐀</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐁</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>𝐀</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐁</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{A}}^{-1}-{\mathbf{B}}^{-1}={\mathbf{A}}^{-1}({\mathbf{B}}-{\mathbf{A}}){\mathbf{B}}^{-1}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem2" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma A.2</span></span><span id="A1.Thmtheorem2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span>(Sherman-Morisson)<span id="A1.Thmtheorem2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">For <math id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{A}}\in{\mathbb{R}}^{p\times p}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐀</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{A}}\in{\mathbb{R}}^{p\times p}</annotation></semantics></math> invertible and <math id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{u}},{\bm{v}}\in{\mathbb{R}}^{p}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝐮</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐯</mi></mrow><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>p</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{u}},{\bm{v}}\in{\mathbb{R}}^{p}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{A}}+{\bm{u}}{\bm{v}}^{\top}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐀</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>𝐮</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{A}}+{\bm{u}}{\bm{v}}^{\top}</annotation></semantics></math> is invertible if and only if: <math id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1+{\bm{v}}^{\top}{\mathbf{A}}^{-1}{\bm{u}}\neq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐀</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐮</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1+{\bm{v}}^{\top}{\mathbf{A}}^{-1}{\bm{u}}\neq 0</annotation></semantics></math>, and:</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex24" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex24.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="({\mathbf{A}}+{\bm{u}}{\bm{v}}^{\top})^{-1}={\mathbf{A}}^{-1}-\frac{{\mathbf{A}}^{-1}{\bm{u}}{\bm{v}}^{\top}{\mathbf{A}}^{-1}}{1+{\bm{v}}^{\top}{\mathbf{A}}^{-1}{\bm{u}}}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐀</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>𝒖</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝒗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐀</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>𝐀</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝒖</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝒗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐀</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝒗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐀</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝒖</mi></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">({\mathbf{A}}+{\bm{u}}{\bm{v}}^{\top})^{-1}={\mathbf{A}}^{-1}-\frac{{\mathbf{A}}^{-1}{\bm{u}}{\bm{v}}^{\top}{\mathbf{A}}^{-1}}{1+{\bm{v}}^{\top}{\mathbf{A}}^{-1}{\bm{u}}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Besides,</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex25" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex25.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="({\mathbf{A}}+{\bm{u}}{\bm{v}}^{\top})^{-1}{\bm{u}}=\frac{{\mathbf{A}}^{-1}{\bm{u}}}{1+{\bm{v}}^{\top}{\mathbf{A}}^{-1}{\bm{u}}}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐀</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>𝒖</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝒗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝒖</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>𝐀</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝒖</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝒗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐀</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝒖</mi></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">({\mathbf{A}}+{\bm{u}}{\bm{v}}^{\top})^{-1}{\bm{u}}=\frac{{\mathbf{A}}^{-1}{\bm{u}}}{1+{\bm{v}}^{\top}{\mathbf{A}}^{-1}{\bm{u}}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Deterministic equivalents</h3>

<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Recall the expression of the resolvents defined in equation equation <a href="#S3.E9" title="In Fine-tuning phase. ‣ 3.1 Theoretical Setting ‣ 3 Problem setting and Background ‣ 𝛼-LoRA: Effective Fine-Tuning via Base Model Rescaling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>:</p>
<table id="A1.Ex26" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex26.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{Q}}=\left(\frac{1}{n}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}+\gamma{\mathbf{I}}_{p}\right)^{-1},{\mathbf{R}}=\left(\frac{1}{N}\tilde{\mathbf{X}}\tilde{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}+\tilde{\gamma}{\mathbf{I}}_{p}\right)^{-1}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐗</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐗</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{Q}}=\left(\frac{1}{n}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}+\gamma{\mathbf{I}}_{p}\right)^{-1},{\mathbf{R}}=\left(\frac{1}{N}\tilde{\mathbf{X}}\tilde{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}+\tilde{\gamma}{\mathbf{I}}_{p}\right)^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.2" class="ltx_p">We define the matrices <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{R}}_{-i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐑</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{R}}_{-i}</annotation></semantics></math> as the resolvents obtained by removing the contribution of the <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i^{th}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i^{th}</annotation></semantics></math> sample, i.e:</p>
<table id="A1.Ex27" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex27.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}=\left(\frac{1}{n}\sum_{k\neq i}{\bm{x}}_{k}{\bm{x}}_{k}^{\top}+\gamma{\mathbf{I}}_{p}\right)^{-1},\quad{\mathbf{R}}_{-i}=\left(\frac{1}{N}\sum_{k\neq i}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{k}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{k}^{\top}+\tilde{\gamma}{\mathbf{I}}_{p}\right)^{-1}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐑</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>k</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}=\left(\frac{1}{n}\sum_{k\neq i}{\bm{x}}_{k}{\bm{x}}_{k}^{\top}+\gamma{\mathbf{I}}_{p}\right)^{-1},\quad{\mathbf{R}}_{-i}=\left(\frac{1}{N}\sum_{k\neq i}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{k}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{k}^{\top}+\tilde{\gamma}{\mathbf{I}}_{p}\right)^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.3" class="ltx_p">then we have that:</p>
<table id="A1.Ex28" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex28.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{Q}}=\left({\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}^{-1}+\frac{1}{n}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}\right)^{-1},\quad{\mathbf{R}}=\left({\mathbf{R}}_{-i}^{-1}+\frac{1}{N}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}\right)^{-1}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐑</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{Q}}=\left({\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}^{-1}+\frac{1}{n}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}\right)^{-1},\quad{\mathbf{R}}=\left({\mathbf{R}}_{-i}^{-1}+\frac{1}{N}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}\right)^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.4" class="ltx_p">Thus by Sherman-Morisson’s lemma:</p>
<table id="A1.Ex29" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex29.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{Q}}={\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}-\frac{1}{n}\frac{{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}}{1+\delta_{Q}},\quad{\mathbf{R}}={\mathbf{R}}_{-i}-\frac{\frac{1}{N}{\mathbf{R}}_{-i}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{R}}_{-i}}{1+\delta_{R}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐑</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐑</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐑</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{Q}}={\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}-\frac{1}{n}\frac{{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}}{1+\delta_{Q}},\quad{\mathbf{R}}={\mathbf{R}}_{-i}-\frac{\frac{1}{N}{\mathbf{R}}_{-i}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{R}}_{-i}}{1+\delta_{R}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.5" class="ltx_p">where:</p>
<table id="A1.Ex30" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex30.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{Q}=\frac{1}{n}\Tr\bar{\mathbf{Q}}=\frac{\eta-\gamma-1+\sqrt{(\eta-\gamma-1)^{2}+4\eta\gamma}}{2\gamma},\quad\delta_{R}=\frac{1}{N}\Tr\bar{\mathbf{R}}=\frac{\tilde{\eta}-\tilde{\gamma}-1+\sqrt{(\tilde{\eta}-\tilde{\gamma}-1)^{2}+4\tilde{\eta}\gamma}}{2\tilde{\gamma}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>η</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>η</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>η</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta_{Q}=\frac{1}{n}\Tr\bar{\mathbf{Q}}=\frac{\eta-\gamma-1+\sqrt{(\eta-\gamma-1)^{2}+4\eta\gamma}}{2\gamma},\quad\delta_{R}=\frac{1}{N}\Tr\bar{\mathbf{R}}=\frac{\tilde{\eta}-\tilde{\gamma}-1+\sqrt{(\tilde{\eta}-\tilde{\gamma}-1)^{2}+4\tilde{\eta}\gamma}}{2\tilde{\gamma}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.6" class="ltx_p">Thus, we get that:</p>
<table id="A1.E12" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}_{i}=\frac{{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}}{1+\delta_{Q}},\quad{\mathbf{R}}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}=\frac{{\mathbf{R}}_{-i}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}}{1+\delta_{R}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝐑</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>𝐑</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}_{i}=\frac{{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}}{1+\delta_{Q}},\quad{\mathbf{R}}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}=\frac{{\mathbf{R}}_{-i}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}}{1+\delta_{R}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(12)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.7" class="ltx_p">Using the above identities, we can easily prove the deterministic equivalents of <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{Q}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐐</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{Q}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{R}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐑</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{R}}</annotation></semantics></math> stated in Lemma <a href="#S3.Thmtheorem5" title="Lemma 3.5 (Deterministic equivalent of 𝐐 and 𝐑). ‣ 3.2 RMT Background ‣ 3 Problem setting and Background ‣ 𝛼-LoRA: Effective Fine-Tuning via Base Model Rescaling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.5</span></a>, which we will do in the following.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem3" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma A.3</span></span><span id="A1.Thmtheorem3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span>(Deterministic equivalent of <math id="A1.Thmtheorem3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{Q}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐐</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{Q}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.Thmtheorem3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{R}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐑</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{R}}</annotation></semantics></math>)<span id="A1.Thmtheorem3.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Under the high-dimensional regime and the assumptions <a href="#S4.Thmtheorem1" title="Assumption 4.1 (Growth Rates). ‣ 4 Main results ‣ 𝛼-LoRA: Effective Fine-Tuning via Base Model Rescaling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.1</span></a>, a deterministic equivalent for <math id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{Q}}\equiv{\mathbf{Q}}(\gamma)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>≡</mo><mrow><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{Q}}\equiv{\mathbf{Q}}(\gamma)</annotation></semantics></math> and for <math id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{R}}\equiv{\mathbf{R}}(\gamma)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>≡</mo><mrow><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{R}}\equiv{\mathbf{R}}(\gamma)</annotation></semantics></math>, denoted <math id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{\mathbf{Q}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{\mathbf{Q}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{\mathbf{R}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{\mathbf{R}}</annotation></semantics></math> respectively, as defined in equation <a href="#S3.E9" title="In Fine-tuning phase. ‣ 3.1 Theoretical Setting ‣ 3 Problem setting and Background ‣ 𝛼-LoRA: Effective Fine-Tuning via Base Model Rescaling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a> are given by:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx9" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex31"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex31.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\bar{\mathbf{Q}}(\gamma)=\left(\frac{{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}+{\mathbf{I}}_{p}}{1+\delta_{Q}}+\gamma{\mathbf{I}}_{p}\right)^{-1},\quad\bar{\mathbf{R}}(\gamma)=\left(\frac{{\bm{\mu}}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}+{\mathbf{I}}_{p}}{1+\delta_{R}}+\gamma{\mathbf{I}}_{p}\right)^{-1}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi>𝝁</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\bar{\mathbf{Q}}(\gamma)=\left(\frac{{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}+{\mathbf{I}}_{p}}{1+\delta_{Q}}+\gamma{\mathbf{I}}_{p}\right)^{-1},\quad\bar{\mathbf{R}}(\gamma)=\left(\frac{{\bm{\mu}}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}+{\mathbf{I}}_{p}}{1+\delta_{R}}+\gamma{\mathbf{I}}_{p}\right)^{-1}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Where:</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex32" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex32.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{Q}=\frac{1}{n}\Tr\bar{\mathbf{Q}}=\frac{\eta-\gamma-1+\sqrt{(\eta-\gamma-1)^{2}+4\eta\gamma}}{2\gamma},\quad\delta_{R}=\frac{1}{N}\Tr\bar{\mathbf{R}}=\frac{\tilde{\eta}-\tilde{\gamma}-1+\sqrt{(\tilde{\eta}-\tilde{\gamma}-1)^{2}+4\tilde{\eta}\gamma}}{2\tilde{\gamma}}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>η</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>η</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>η</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta_{Q}=\frac{1}{n}\Tr\bar{\mathbf{Q}}=\frac{\eta-\gamma-1+\sqrt{(\eta-\gamma-1)^{2}+4\eta\gamma}}{2\gamma},\quad\delta_{R}=\frac{1}{N}\Tr\bar{\mathbf{R}}=\frac{\tilde{\eta}-\tilde{\gamma}-1+\sqrt{(\tilde{\eta}-\tilde{\gamma}-1)^{2}+4\tilde{\eta}\gamma}}{2\tilde{\gamma}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text">We will prove the deterministic equivalent of <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{Q}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐐</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{Q}}</annotation></semantics></math>, and the proof of <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{\mathbf{R}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{\mathbf{R}}</annotation></semantics></math> can be derived similarly. In general, we want to find a deterministic equivalent <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{\mathbf{Q}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{\mathbf{Q}}</annotation></semantics></math> of the same form of <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{Q}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐐</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{Q}}</annotation></semantics></math>, i.e we consider <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{\mathbf{Q}}(\gamma)=\left({\mathbf{S}}+\gamma{\mathbf{I}}_{p}\right)^{-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐒</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{\mathbf{Q}}(\gamma)=\left({\mathbf{S}}+\gamma{\mathbf{I}}_{p}\right)^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math> and we want to find a deterministic matrix <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{S}}\in{\mathbb{R}}^{p\times p}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐒</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{S}}\in{\mathbb{R}}^{p\times p}</annotation></semantics></math> such that for any linear form <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>u</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u</annotation></semantics></math>:</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex33" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex33.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u({\mathbf{Q}})\asto u(\bar{\mathbf{Q}})," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mo>→</mo><mtext mathsize="0.700em">a.s.</mtext></mover><mi>u</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u({\mathbf{Q}})\asto u(\bar{\mathbf{Q}}),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p2.2.1" class="ltx_text">Or more simply:</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex34" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex34.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u(\E[{\mathbf{Q}}]-\bar{\mathbf{Q}})\to 0." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u(\E[{\mathbf{Q}}]-\bar{\mathbf{Q}})\to 0.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p2.3.1" class="ltx_text">We have that:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx10" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex35"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex35.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\E[{\mathbf{Q}}]-\bar{\mathbf{Q}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\E[{\mathbf{Q}}]-\bar{\mathbf{Q}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex35.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\E[{\mathbf{Q}}-\bar{\mathbf{Q}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>−</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\E[{\mathbf{Q}}-\bar{\mathbf{Q}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex36"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex36.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\E[{\mathbf{Q}}\left({\mathbf{S}}-\frac{1}{n}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}\right)\bar{\mathbf{Q}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐒</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\E[{\mathbf{Q}}\left({\mathbf{S}}-\frac{1}{n}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}\right)\bar{\mathbf{Q}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex37"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex37.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\E\left[\left({\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{S}}-\frac{1}{n}\sum_{i=1}^{n}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}\right)\bar{\mathbf{Q}}\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐐𝐒</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\E\left[\left({\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{S}}-\frac{1}{n}\sum_{i=1}^{n}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}\right)\bar{\mathbf{Q}}\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p2.4.1" class="ltx_text">And since: <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}_{i}=\frac{{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}}{1+\delta_{Q}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}_{i}=\frac{{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}}{1+\delta_{Q}}</annotation></semantics></math> and that we want <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\E[{\mathbf{Q}}]=\bar{\mathbf{Q}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\E[{\mathbf{Q}}]=\bar{\mathbf{Q}}</annotation></semantics></math> in linear forms, we get that:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx11" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex38"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex38.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\E\left[\left({\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{S}}-\frac{1}{n}\sum_{i=1}^{n}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}\right)\bar{\mathbf{Q}}\right]=\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{S}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}-\frac{1}{n}\sum_{i=1}^{n}\frac{1}{1+\delta_{Q}}\E[{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}]\bar{\mathbf{Q}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐐𝐒</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐒</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\E\left[\left({\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{S}}-\frac{1}{n}\sum_{i=1}^{n}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}\right)\bar{\mathbf{Q}}\right]=\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{S}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}-\frac{1}{n}\sum_{i=1}^{n}\frac{1}{1+\delta_{Q}}\E[{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}]\bar{\mathbf{Q}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright" colspan="2"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex39"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex39.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{S}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}-\frac{1}{n}\sum_{i=1}^{n}\frac{1}{1+\delta_{Q}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}({\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}+{\mathbf{I}}_{p})\bar{\mathbf{Q}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐒</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{S}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}-\frac{1}{n}\sum_{i=1}^{n}\frac{1}{1+\delta_{Q}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}({\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}+{\mathbf{I}}_{p})\bar{\mathbf{Q}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex39.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(\text{By independence of ${\bm{x}}_{i}$ and ${\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}$})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mtext>By independence of </mtext><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> and </mtext><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(\text{By independence of ${\bm{x}}_{i}$ and ${\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}$})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex40"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex40.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\bar{\mathbf{Q}}\left({\mathbf{S}}-\frac{{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}+{\mathbf{I}}_{p}}{1+\delta_{Q}}\right)\bar{\mathbf{Q}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐒</mi><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\bar{\mathbf{Q}}\left({\mathbf{S}}-\frac{{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}+{\mathbf{I}}_{p}}{1+\delta_{Q}}\right)\bar{\mathbf{Q}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright" colspan="2"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p2.5.1" class="ltx_text">Finally, it suffices to take: <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{S}}=\frac{{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}+{\mathbf{I}}_{p}}{1+\delta_{Q}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐒</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{S}}=\frac{{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}+{\mathbf{I}}_{p}}{1+\delta_{Q}}</annotation></semantics></math> to get the desired result.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem4" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma A.4</span></span><span id="A1.Thmtheorem4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span>(Trace identities)<span id="A1.Thmtheorem4.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Let <math id="A1.Thmtheorem4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{\mathbf{Q}},\bar{\mathbf{R}}\in{\mathbb{R}}^{p\times p}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{\mathbf{Q}},\bar{\mathbf{R}}\in{\mathbb{R}}^{p\times p}</annotation></semantics></math> be the deterministic matrices defined in lemma <a href="#S3.Thmtheorem5" title="Lemma 3.5 (Deterministic equivalent of 𝐐 and 𝐑). ‣ 3.2 RMT Background ‣ 3 Problem setting and Background ‣ 𝛼-LoRA: Effective Fine-Tuning via Base Model Rescaling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.5</span></a>. Then:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx12" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex41"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex41.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{1}{n}\frac{\Tr((\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{Q}})^{2})}{(1+\delta_{Q})^{2}}=\frac{\eta}{(1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q}))^{2}},\quad\frac{1}{N}\frac{\Tr((\Sigma\bar{\mathbf{R}})^{2})}{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}=\frac{\tilde{\eta}}{(1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R}))^{2}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>η</mi><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mover accent="true"><mi>η</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{1}{n}\frac{\Tr((\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{Q}})^{2})}{(1+\delta_{Q})^{2}}=\frac{\eta}{(1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q}))^{2}},\quad\frac{1}{N}\frac{\Tr((\Sigma\bar{\mathbf{R}})^{2})}{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}=\frac{\tilde{\eta}}{(1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R}))^{2}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem4.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem4.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">And:</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex42" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex42.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{1}{N}\Tr(\bar{\mathbf{R}}^{2}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}^{2})=\tilde{\eta}\left(\frac{(1+\delta_{R})(1+\delta_{Q})}{(1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R}))(1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q}))}\right)^{2}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>η</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{1}{N}\Tr(\bar{\mathbf{R}}^{2}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}^{2})=\tilde{\eta}\left(\frac{(1+\delta_{R})(1+\delta_{Q})}{(1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R}))(1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q}))}\right)^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem5" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma A.5</span></span><span id="A1.Thmtheorem5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span>(Relevant Identities)<span id="A1.Thmtheorem5.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Let <math id="A1.Thmtheorem5.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{\mathbf{Q}},\bar{\mathbf{R}}\in{\mathbb{R}}^{p\times p}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{\mathbf{Q}},\bar{\mathbf{R}}\in{\mathbb{R}}^{p\times p}</annotation></semantics></math> be the deterministic matrices defined in lemma <a href="#S3.Thmtheorem5" title="Lemma 3.5 (Deterministic equivalent of 𝐐 and 𝐑). ‣ 3.2 RMT Background ‣ 3 Problem setting and Background ‣ 𝛼-LoRA: Effective Fine-Tuning via Base Model Rescaling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.5</span></a>. Then we have the following identities:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx13" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex43"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex43.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}=\frac{(1+\delta_{Q})\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}}{\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q})},\quad{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}^{2}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}=\left(\frac{(1+\delta_{Q})\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|}{\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q})}\right)^{2}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}=\frac{(1+\delta_{Q})\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}}{\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q})},\quad{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}^{2}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}=\left(\frac{(1+\delta_{Q})\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|}{\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q})}\right)^{2},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<table id="A1.EGx14" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex44"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex44.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}=\frac{(1+\delta_{R})\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}}{\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}+1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R})},\quad{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}^{2}{\bm{\mu}}=\left(\frac{(1+\delta_{R})\|{\bm{\mu}}\|}{\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}+1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R})}\right)^{2}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}=\frac{(1+\delta_{R})\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}}{\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}+1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R})},\quad{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}^{2}{\bm{\mu}}=\left(\frac{(1+\delta_{R})\|{\bm{\mu}}\|}{\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}+1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R})}\right)^{2},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<table id="A1.EGx15" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex45"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex45.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}=\frac{(1+\delta_{R})(1+\delta_{Q})\beta\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}}{(\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}+1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R}))(\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q}))}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}=\frac{(1+\delta_{R})(1+\delta_{Q})\beta\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}}{(\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}+1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R}))(\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q}))},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<table id="A1.EGx16" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex46"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex46.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}^{2}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}=\frac{(1+\delta_{R})}{(\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}+1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R}))}\left(\frac{(1+\delta_{Q})}{(\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q}))}\right)^{2}\beta\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}^{2}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}=\frac{(1+\delta_{R})}{(\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}+1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R}))}\left(\frac{(1+\delta_{Q})}{(\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q}))}\right)^{2}\beta\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem5.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem5.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">And finally:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx17" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex47"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex47.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}^{2}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}^{2}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex48"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex48.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\left(\frac{(1+\delta_{R})(1+\delta_{Q})\|{\bm{\mu}}\|}{(1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q}))(\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}+1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R}))}\right)^{2}\left(1+\frac{\beta^{3}\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{4}}{(\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q}))^{2}}-\frac{2\beta^{2}\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}}{\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q})}\right)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>β</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\left(\frac{(1+\delta_{R})(1+\delta_{Q})\|{\bm{\mu}}\|}{(1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q}))(\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}+1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R}))}\right)^{2}\left(1+\frac{\beta^{3}\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{4}}{(\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q}))^{2}}-\frac{2\beta^{2}\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}}{\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q})}\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.3" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.SS2.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text">The proof of all these identities relies on the following results:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx18" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex49"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex49.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\bar{\mathbf{R}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\bar{\mathbf{R}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex49.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\left(\frac{{\bm{\mu}}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}}{1+\delta_{R}}+\left(\tilde{\gamma}+\frac{1}{1+\delta_{R}}\right){\mathbf{I}}_{p}\right)^{-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>𝝁</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\left(\frac{{\bm{\mu}}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}}{1+\delta_{R}}+\left(\tilde{\gamma}+\frac{1}{1+\delta_{R}}\right){\mathbf{I}}_{p}\right)^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright" colspan="2"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex50"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex50.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=(1+\delta_{R})\left({\bm{\mu}}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}+(1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R}){\mathbf{I}}_{p})\right)^{-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝝁</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=(1+\delta_{R})\left({\bm{\mu}}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}+(1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R}){\mathbf{I}}_{p})\right)^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright" colspan="2"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex51"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex51.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1+\delta_{R}}{1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R})}\left(\frac{{\bm{\mu}}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}}{1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R})}+{\mathbf{I}}_{p}\right)^{-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>𝝁</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1+\delta_{R}}{1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R})}\left(\frac{{\bm{\mu}}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}}{1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R})}+{\mathbf{I}}_{p}\right)^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright" colspan="2"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex52"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex52.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1+\delta_{R}}{1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R})}\left({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\frac{{\bm{\mu}}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}}{\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}+1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R})}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>𝝁</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1+\delta_{R}}{1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R})}\left({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\frac{{\bm{\mu}}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}}{\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}+1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R})}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex52.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(\text{lemma \ref{lemma:Sherman-Morisson}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mtext>lemma </mtext><mtext><a href="#A1.Thmtheorem2" title="Lemma A.2 (Sherman-Morisson). ‣ A.1 General lemmas ‣ Appendix A Useful results ‣ 𝛼-LoRA: Effective Fine-Tuning via Base Model Rescaling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.2</span></a></mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(\text{lemma \ref{lemma:Sherman-Morisson}})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p3.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p3.2.1" class="ltx_text">where the last equality is obtained using Sherman-Morisson’s identity (lemma <a href="#A1.Thmtheorem2" title="Lemma A.2 (Sherman-Morisson). ‣ A.1 General lemmas ‣ Appendix A Useful results ‣ 𝛼-LoRA: Effective Fine-Tuning via Base Model Rescaling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.2</span></a>).
Hence,</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx19" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex53"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex53.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(\bar{\mathbf{R}})^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(\bar{\mathbf{R}})^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex53.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}{(1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R}))^{2}}\left({\mathbf{I}}_{p}+\frac{({\bm{\mu}}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top})^{2}}{(\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}+1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R}))^{2}}-\frac{2{\bm{\mu}}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}}{\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}+1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R})}\right)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝝁</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}{(1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R}))^{2}}\left({\mathbf{I}}_{p}+\frac{({\bm{\mu}}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top})^{2}}{(\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}+1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R}))^{2}}-\frac{2{\bm{\mu}}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}}{\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}+1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R})}\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p3.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p3.3.1" class="ltx_text">And the same for <math id="A1.SS2.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{\mathbf{Q}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{\mathbf{Q}}</annotation></semantics></math>:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx20" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex54"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex54.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\bar{\mathbf{Q}}=\frac{1+\delta_{Q}}{1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q})}\left({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\frac{{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}}{\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q})}\right)," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\bar{\mathbf{Q}}=\frac{1+\delta_{Q}}{1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q})}\left({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\frac{{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}}{\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q})}\right),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<table id="A1.EGx21" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex55"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex55.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(\bar{\mathbf{Q}})^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(\bar{\mathbf{Q}})^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex55.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{(1+\delta_{Q})^{2}}{(1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q}))^{2}}\left({\mathbf{I}}_{p}+\frac{({\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top})^{2}}{(\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q}))^{2}}-\frac{2{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}}{\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q})}\right)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{(1+\delta_{Q})^{2}}{(1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q}))^{2}}\left({\mathbf{I}}_{p}+\frac{({\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top})^{2}}{(\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q}))^{2}}-\frac{2{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}}{\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q})}\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p3.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p3.4.1" class="ltx_text">And using the second identity in Sherman-Morisson’s lemma <a href="#A1.Thmtheorem2" title="Lemma A.2 (Sherman-Morisson). ‣ A.1 General lemmas ‣ Appendix A Useful results ‣ 𝛼-LoRA: Effective Fine-Tuning via Base Model Rescaling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.2</span></a>:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx22" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex56"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex56.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}=\frac{(1+\delta_{R})}{\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}+1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R})}{\bm{\mu}},\quad\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}=\frac{(1+\delta_{Q})}{\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q})}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}=\frac{(1+\delta_{R})}{\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}+1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R})}{\bm{\mu}},\quad\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}=\frac{(1+\delta_{Q})}{\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q})}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text">∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem6" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma A.6</span></span><span id="A1.Thmtheorem6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span>(Expectation some classifiers)<span id="A1.Thmtheorem6.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem6.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem6.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem6.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Let <math id="A1.Thmtheorem6.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{\bm{w}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{\bm{w}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.Thmtheorem6.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{w}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐰</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{w}}</annotation></semantics></math> be the classifiers defined earlier equation <a href="#S3.Ex3" title="In Fine-tuning phase. ‣ 3.1 Theoretical Setting ‣ 3 Problem setting and Background ‣ 𝛼-LoRA: Effective Fine-Tuning via Base Model Rescaling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">
                  
                    α
                  
                -FTC</span></a>. We have that:</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex57" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex57.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}]=\frac{1}{1+\delta_{R}}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}},\quad\E[{\bm{w}}]=\frac{1}{1+\delta_{Q}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝐰</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}]=\frac{1}{1+\delta_{R}}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}},\quad\E[{\bm{w}}]=\frac{1}{1+\delta_{Q}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.4" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.SS2.p5" class="ltx_para">
<table id="A1.EGx23" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex58"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex58.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex58.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\E[\tilde{y}_{i}{\mathbf{R}}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐑</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\E[\tilde{y}_{i}{\mathbf{R}}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex59"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex59.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\frac{1}{1+\delta_{R}}\E[\tilde{y}_{i}{\mathbf{R}}_{-i}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐑</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\frac{1}{1+\delta_{R}}\E[\tilde{y}_{i}{\mathbf{R}}_{-i}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex60"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex60.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{1+\delta_{R}}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{1+\delta_{R}}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text">The proof of <math id="A1.SS2.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\E[{\bm{w}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝐰</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\E[{\bm{w}}]</annotation></semantics></math> is similar to this latter.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem7" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem7.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma A.7</span></span><span id="A1.Thmtheorem7.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span>(Deterministic equivalent)<span id="A1.Thmtheorem7.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem7.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem7.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem7.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">For any positive semi-definite matrix <math id="A1.Thmtheorem7.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{A}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐀</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{A}}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have:</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex61" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex61.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}\leftrightarrow\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}+\frac{1}{n}\frac{\Tr(\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}})}{(1+\delta_{Q})^{2}}\E[{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}]," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝐐𝐀𝐐</mi><mo stretchy="false">↔</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}\leftrightarrow\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}+\frac{1}{n}\frac{\Tr(\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}})}{(1+\delta_{Q})^{2}}\E[{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}],</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem7.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem7.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">and:</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex62" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex62.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}\leftrightarrow\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}\bar{\mathbf{R}}+\frac{1}{N}\frac{\Tr(\Sigma\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}\bar{\mathbf{R}})}{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}\E[{\mathbf{R}}\Sigma{\mathbf{R}}]." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝐑𝐀𝐑</mi><mo stretchy="false">↔</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐑</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐑</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}\leftrightarrow\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}\bar{\mathbf{R}}+\frac{1}{N}\frac{\Tr(\Sigma\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}\bar{\mathbf{R}})}{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}\E[{\mathbf{R}}\Sigma{\mathbf{R}}].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem7.p1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem7.p1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">In particular for every <math id="A1.Thmtheorem7.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{a}},{\bm{b}}\in{\mathbb{R}}^{p}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝐚</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐛</mi></mrow><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>p</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{a}},{\bm{b}}\in{\mathbb{R}}^{p}</annotation></semantics></math>:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx24" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex63"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex63.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle{\bm{a}}^{\top}\E[{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}]{\bm{b}}=\frac{1}{h}{\bm{a}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{b}},\quad{\bm{a}}^{\top}\E[{\mathbf{R}}\Sigma{\mathbf{R}}]{\bm{b}}=\frac{1}{\tilde{h}}{\bm{a}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}\Sigma\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{b}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>𝒂</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐛</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>h</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐚</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐛</mi></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>𝐚</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐑</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐑</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐛</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mover accent="true"><mi>h</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐚</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐛</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle{\bm{a}}^{\top}\E[{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}]{\bm{b}}=\frac{1}{h}{\bm{a}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{b}},\quad{\bm{a}}^{\top}\E[{\mathbf{R}}\Sigma{\mathbf{R}}]{\bm{b}}=\frac{1}{\tilde{h}}{\bm{a}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}\Sigma\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{b}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.5" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.SS2.p6" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p6.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p6.1.1" class="ltx_text">The proof is derived similarly as in the appendix of <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib7" title="" class="ltx_ref">Firdoussi &amp; Seddik (2024)</a></cite>. Again, the proof is similar for both <math id="A1.SS2.p6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{Q}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐐</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{Q}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS2.p6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{R}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐑</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{R}}</annotation></semantics></math>.
<br class="ltx_break">Let <math id="A1.SS2.p6.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{\mathbf{Q}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{\mathbf{Q}}</annotation></semantics></math> be a deterministic equivalent of <math id="A1.SS2.p6.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{Q}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐐</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{Q}}</annotation></semantics></math>. The following equations and identities are valid in terms of linear forms. We have that:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx25" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex64"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex64.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\E[{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝐐𝐀𝐐</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\E[{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex64.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\E[\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}]+\E[({\mathbf{Q}}-\bar{\mathbf{Q}}){\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐀𝐐</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>−</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐀𝐐</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\E[\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}]+\E[({\mathbf{Q}}-\bar{\mathbf{Q}}){\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex65"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex65.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\bar{\mathbf{Q}}(\E[{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}]+{\mathbf{A}}\E[{\mathbf{Q}}-\bar{\mathbf{Q}}])+\E[({\mathbf{Q}}-\bar{\mathbf{Q}}){\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝐀𝐐</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>−</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>−</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐀𝐐</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\bar{\mathbf{Q}}(\E[{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}]+{\mathbf{A}}\E[{\mathbf{Q}}-\bar{\mathbf{Q}}])+\E[({\mathbf{Q}}-\bar{\mathbf{Q}}){\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex66"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex66.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}+\E[({\mathbf{Q}}-\bar{\mathbf{Q}}){\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>−</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐀𝐐</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}+\E[({\mathbf{Q}}-\bar{\mathbf{Q}}){\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p6.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p6.2.1" class="ltx_text">Using lemma <a href="#A1.Thmtheorem1" title="Lemma A.1 (Resolvent identity). ‣ A.1 General lemmas ‣ Appendix A Useful results ‣ 𝛼-LoRA: Effective Fine-Tuning via Base Model Rescaling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.1</span></a>, we have that:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx26" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex67"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex67.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle{\mathbf{Q}}-\bar{\mathbf{Q}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>−</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle{\mathbf{Q}}-\bar{\mathbf{Q}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex67.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle={\mathbf{Q}}(\bar{\mathbf{Q}}^{-1}-{\mathbf{Q}}^{-1})\bar{\mathbf{Q}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle={\mathbf{Q}}(\bar{\mathbf{Q}}^{-1}-{\mathbf{Q}}^{-1})\bar{\mathbf{Q}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex68"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex68.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle={\mathbf{Q}}\left(\frac{\Sigma_{\beta}}{1+\delta_{Q}}-\frac{1}{n}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}\right)\bar{\mathbf{Q}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle={\mathbf{Q}}\left(\frac{\Sigma_{\beta}}{1+\delta_{Q}}-\frac{1}{n}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}\right)\bar{\mathbf{Q}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex69"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex69.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle={\mathbf{Q}}\left({\mathbf{S}}-\frac{1}{n}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}\right)\bar{\mathbf{Q}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐒</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle={\mathbf{Q}}\left({\mathbf{S}}-\frac{1}{n}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}\right)\bar{\mathbf{Q}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p6.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p6.3.1" class="ltx_text">Thus:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx27" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex70"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex70.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\E[{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝐐𝐀𝐐</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\E[{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex70.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}+\E[{\mathbf{Q}}({\mathbf{S}}-\frac{1}{n}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top})\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐒</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐀𝐐</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}+\E[{\mathbf{Q}}({\mathbf{S}}-\frac{1}{n}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top})\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex71"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex71.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}+\E[{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{S}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}]-\frac{1}{n}\sum_{i=1}^{n}\E[{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐐𝐒</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐀𝐐</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐀𝐐</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}+\E[{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{S}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}]-\frac{1}{n}\sum_{i=1}^{n}\E[{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p6.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p6.4.1" class="ltx_text">We have that:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx28" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex72"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex72.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\E[{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐀𝐐</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\E[{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex72.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{1+\delta_{Q}}\E[{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐀𝐐</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{1+\delta_{Q}}\E[{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex73"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex73.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{1+\delta_{Q}}\left(\E[{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}]-\E[{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}\frac{{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}}{n(1+\delta_{Q})}]\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{1+\delta_{Q}}\left(\E[{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}]-\E[{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}\frac{{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}}{n(1+\delta_{Q})}]\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex74"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex74.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{1+\delta_{Q}}\left(\E[{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}]-\E[{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}\frac{{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}}{n(1+\delta_{Q})}]\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐀𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{1+\delta_{Q}}\left(\E[{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}]-\E[{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}\frac{{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}}{n(1+\delta_{Q})}]\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex75"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex75.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{1+\delta_{Q}}\left(\E[{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}]-\E[{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}\frac{{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}}{n(1+\delta_{Q})}]\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐀𝐐</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{1+\delta_{Q}}\left(\E[{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}]-\E[{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}\frac{{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}}{n(1+\delta_{Q})}]\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p6.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p6.5.1" class="ltx_text">Therefore, by replacing the obtained expression of <math id="A1.SS2.p6.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\E[{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐀𝐐</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\E[{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}]</annotation></semantics></math> in the equation of <math id="A1.SS2.p6.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\E[{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝐐𝐀𝐐</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\E[{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}]</annotation></semantics></math>, we get that:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx29" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex76"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex76.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\E[{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝐐𝐀𝐐</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\E[{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex76.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}+\frac{1}{n^{2}(1+\delta_{Q})^{2}}\sum_{i=1}^{n}\E[{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐀𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}+\frac{1}{n^{2}(1+\delta_{Q})^{2}}\sum_{i=1}^{n}\E[{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex77"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex77.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}+\frac{1}{n^{2}(1+\delta_{Q})^{2}}\sum_{i=1}^{n}\Tr(\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}})\E[{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}+\frac{1}{n^{2}(1+\delta_{Q})^{2}}\sum_{i=1}^{n}\Tr(\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}})\E[{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex78"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex78.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}+\frac{1}{n^{2}(1+\delta_{Q})^{2}}\sum_{i=1}^{n}\Tr(\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}})\E[{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}+\frac{1}{n^{2}(1+\delta_{Q})^{2}}\sum_{i=1}^{n}\Tr(\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}})\E[{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex79"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex79.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}+\frac{1}{n}\frac{\Tr(\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}})}{(1+\delta_{Q})^{2}}\E[{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}+\frac{1}{n}\frac{\Tr(\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{A}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}})}{(1+\delta_{Q})^{2}}\E[{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p6.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p6.6.1" class="ltx_text">Which finally concludes the proof.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.p7" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.p7.1" class="ltx_p">Now we will provide the result of a useful quantity that we will be using for computing the variance.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem8" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem8.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma A.8</span></span><span id="A1.Thmtheorem8.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span>(Expectation of <math id="A1.Thmtheorem8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{A}}\tilde{\bm{w}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒘</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒘</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{A}}\tilde{\bm{w}}</annotation></semantics></math>)<span id="A1.Thmtheorem8.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem8.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem8.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem8.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Let <math id="A1.Thmtheorem8.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{A}}\in{\mathbb{R}}^{p\times p}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐀</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{A}}\in{\mathbb{R}}^{p\times p}</annotation></semantics></math> be a random matrix independent of <math id="A1.Thmtheorem8.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{\bm{w}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{\bm{w}}</annotation></semantics></math>. We have that:</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex80" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex80.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{A}}\tilde{\bm{w}}]=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}\left({\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}]{\bm{\mu}}-\frac{2}{N(1+\delta_{R})}\Tr(\Sigma\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}]){\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}+\frac{1}{N}\Tr(\Sigma\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}])\right)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝐑𝐀𝐑</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝐑𝐀𝐑</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝐑𝐀𝐑</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{A}}\tilde{\bm{w}}]=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}\left({\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}]{\bm{\mu}}-\frac{2}{N(1+\delta_{R})}\Tr(\Sigma\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}]){\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}+\frac{1}{N}\Tr(\Sigma\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}])\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.6" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.SS2.p8" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.p8.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p8.1.1" class="ltx_text">We have that:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx30" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex81"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex81.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{A}}\tilde{\bm{w}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{A}}\tilde{\bm{w}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex81.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{N^{2}}\sum_{i,j=1}^{N}\E[\tilde{y}_{i}\tilde{y}_{j}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{j}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐑𝐀𝐑</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{N^{2}}\sum_{i,j=1}^{N}\E[\tilde{y}_{i}\tilde{y}_{j}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{j}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex82"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex82.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{N^{2}}\sum_{i\neq j}\E[\tilde{y}_{i}\tilde{y}_{j}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{j}]+\frac{1}{N^{2}}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\E[\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐑𝐀𝐑</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐑𝐀𝐑</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{N^{2}}\sum_{i\neq j}\E[\tilde{y}_{i}\tilde{y}_{j}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{j}]+\frac{1}{N^{2}}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\E[\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.p9" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.p9.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p9.1.1" class="ltx_text">We have for <math id="A1.SS2.p9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\neq j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\neq j</annotation></semantics></math>:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx31" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex83"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex83.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\E[\tilde{y}_{i}\tilde{y}_{j}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{j}]=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}\E[\tilde{y}_{i}\tilde{y}_{j}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}{\mathbf{R}}_{-i}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}_{-i}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{j}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐑𝐀𝐑</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐑</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐀𝐑</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\E[\tilde{y}_{i}\tilde{y}_{j}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{j}]=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}\E[\tilde{y}_{i}\tilde{y}_{j}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}{\mathbf{R}}_{-i}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}_{-i}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{j}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex84"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex84.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}\E\left[\tilde{y}_{i}\tilde{y}_{j}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}\left({\mathbf{R}}_{-ij}-\frac{\frac{1}{N}{\mathbf{R}}_{-ij}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{j}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{j}^{\top}{\mathbf{R}}_{-ij}}{1+\delta_{R}}\right){\mathbf{A}}\left({\mathbf{R}}_{-ij}-\frac{\frac{1}{N}{\mathbf{R}}_{-ij}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{R}}_{-ij}}{1+\delta_{R}}\right)\tilde{\bm{x}}_{j}\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐑</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>ij</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐑</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>ij</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>j</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐑</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>ij</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐑</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>ij</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐑</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>ij</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐑</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>ij</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}\E\left[\tilde{y}_{i}\tilde{y}_{j}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}\left({\mathbf{R}}_{-ij}-\frac{\frac{1}{N}{\mathbf{R}}_{-ij}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{j}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{j}^{\top}{\mathbf{R}}_{-ij}}{1+\delta_{R}}\right){\mathbf{A}}\left({\mathbf{R}}_{-ij}-\frac{\frac{1}{N}{\mathbf{R}}_{-ij}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{R}}_{-ij}}{1+\delta_{R}}\right)\tilde{\bm{x}}_{j}\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex85"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex85.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=A_{11}-A_{12}-A_{13}+A_{14}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>11</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>12</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>13</mn></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>14</mn></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=A_{11}-A_{12}-A_{13}+A_{14}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p9.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p9.2.1" class="ltx_text">So let us compute each term independently:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx32" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex86"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex86.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle A_{11}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>11</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle A_{11}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex86.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}\E[\tilde{y}_{i}\tilde{y}_{j}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{R}}_{-ij}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}_{-ij}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{j}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐑</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>ij</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐀𝐑</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>ij</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}\E[\tilde{y}_{i}\tilde{y}_{j}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{R}}_{-ij}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}_{-ij}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{j}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex87"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex87.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}]{\bm{\mu}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝐑𝐀𝐑</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}]{\bm{\mu}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p9.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p9.3.1" class="ltx_text">And :</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx33" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex88"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex88.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle A_{12}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>12</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle A_{12}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex88.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{N(1+\delta_{R})^{3}}\E[\tilde{y}_{i}\tilde{y}_{j}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{R}}_{-ij}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}_{-ij}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{R}}_{-ij}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{j}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐑</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>ij</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐀𝐑</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>ij</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐑</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>ij</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{N(1+\delta_{R})^{3}}\E[\tilde{y}_{i}\tilde{y}_{j}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{R}}_{-ij}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}_{-ij}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{R}}_{-ij}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{j}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex89"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex89.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{N(1+\delta_{R})^{3}}\Tr(\Sigma\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}])\E[\tilde{y}_{i}\tilde{y}_{j}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{R}}_{-ij}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{j}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝐑𝐀𝐑</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐑</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>ij</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{N(1+\delta_{R})^{3}}\Tr(\Sigma\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}])\E[\tilde{y}_{i}\tilde{y}_{j}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{R}}_{-ij}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{j}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex90"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex90.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{N(1+\delta_{R})^{3}}\Tr(\Sigma\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}]){\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝐑𝐀𝐑</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{N(1+\delta_{R})^{3}}\Tr(\Sigma\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}]){\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p9.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p9.4.1" class="ltx_text">And also we can easily observe that:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx34" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex91"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex91.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle A_{13}=A_{12},\quad A_{14}={\mathcal{O}}(N^{-1})." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>13</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>12</mn></msub></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>14</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle A_{13}=A_{12},\quad A_{14}={\mathcal{O}}(N^{-1}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p9.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p9.5.1" class="ltx_text">Thus:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx35" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex92"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex92.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\E[\tilde{y}_{i}\tilde{y}_{j}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{j}]=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}\left({\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}]{\bm{\mu}}-\frac{2}{N(1+\delta_{R})}\Tr(\Sigma\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}]){\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐑𝐀𝐑</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝐑𝐀𝐑</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝐑𝐀𝐑</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\E[\tilde{y}_{i}\tilde{y}_{j}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{j}]=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}\left({\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}]{\bm{\mu}}-\frac{2}{N(1+\delta_{R})}\Tr(\Sigma\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}]){\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p9.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p9.6.1" class="ltx_text">And for the second term in the equation of <math id="A1.SS2.p9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}{\mathbf{A}}\tilde{\bm{w}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}{\mathbf{A}}\tilde{\bm{w}}]</annotation></semantics></math>, we have:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx36" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex93"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex93.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\E[\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐑𝐀𝐑</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\E[\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex93.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}\E[\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{R}}_{-i}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}_{-i}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐑</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐀𝐑</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}\E[\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{R}}_{-i}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}_{-i}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex94"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex94.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}\E[\Tr(\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{R}}_{-i}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}_{-i})]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐑</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐀𝐑</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}\E[\Tr(\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{R}}_{-i}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}_{-i})]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex95"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex95.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}\Tr(\E[\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}]\E[{\mathbf{R}}_{-i}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}_{-i}])" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐑</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐀𝐑</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}\Tr(\E[\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}\tilde{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}]\E[{\mathbf{R}}_{-i}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}_{-i}])</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex96"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex96.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}\Tr(\Sigma\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}])" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝐑𝐀𝐑</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}\Tr(\Sigma\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}])</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p9.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p9.7.1" class="ltx_text">Hence, finally:</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex97" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex97.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{A}}\tilde{\bm{w}}]=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}\left({\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}]{\bm{\mu}}-\frac{2}{N(1+\delta_{R})}\Tr(\Sigma\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}]){\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}+\frac{1}{N}\Tr(\Sigma\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}])\right)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐀</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝐑𝐀𝐑</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝐑𝐀𝐑</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝐑𝐀𝐑</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{A}}\tilde{\bm{w}}]=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}\left({\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}]{\bm{\mu}}-\frac{2}{N(1+\delta_{R})}\Tr(\Sigma\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}]){\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}+\frac{1}{N}\Tr(\Sigma\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{A}}{\mathbf{R}}])\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p9.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p9.8.1" class="ltx_text">∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem9" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem9.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma A.9</span></span><span id="A1.Thmtheorem9.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span>(Commutativity)<span id="A1.Thmtheorem9.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem9.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem9.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem9.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Let <math id="A1.Thmtheorem9.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{\mathbf{R}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{\mathbf{R}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.Thmtheorem9.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{\mathbf{Q}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{\mathbf{Q}}</annotation></semantics></math> be the resolvent matrices defined in lemma <a href="#S3.Thmtheorem5" title="Lemma 3.5 (Deterministic equivalent of 𝐐 and 𝐑). ‣ 3.2 RMT Background ‣ 3 Problem setting and Background ‣ 𝛼-LoRA: Effective Fine-Tuning via Base Model Rescaling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.5</span></a>. We have that:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx37" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex98"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex98.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\bar{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}=\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{Q}},\quad\bar{\mathbf{R}}\Sigma=\Sigma\bar{\mathbf{R}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\bar{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}=\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{Q}},\quad\bar{\mathbf{R}}\Sigma=\Sigma\bar{\mathbf{R}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.7" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.SS2.p10" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.p10.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p10.1.1" class="ltx_text">We will just prove it for <math id="A1.SS2.p10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{\mathbf{Q}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{\mathbf{Q}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS2.p10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Sigma_{\beta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Sigma_{\beta}</annotation></semantics></math> because the other proof of the second identity is similar. We know that:</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex99" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex99.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Sigma_{\beta}=(1+\delta_{Q})(\bar{\mathbf{Q}}^{-1}-\gamma{\mathbf{I}}_{p})" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Sigma_{\beta}=(1+\delta_{Q})(\bar{\mathbf{Q}}^{-1}-\gamma{\mathbf{I}}_{p})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p10.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p10.2.1" class="ltx_text">Thus:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx38" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex100"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex100.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\bar{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}=(1+\delta_{Q})\bar{\mathbf{Q}}(\bar{\mathbf{Q}}^{-1}-\gamma{\mathbf{I}}_{p})=(1+\delta_{Q})({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\gamma\bar{\mathbf{Q}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\bar{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}=(1+\delta_{Q})\bar{\mathbf{Q}}(\bar{\mathbf{Q}}^{-1}-\gamma{\mathbf{I}}_{p})=(1+\delta_{Q})({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\gamma\bar{\mathbf{Q}})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex101"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex101.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}=(1+\delta_{Q})(\bar{\mathbf{Q}}^{-1}-\gamma{\mathbf{I}}_{p})\bar{\mathbf{Q}}=(1+\delta_{Q})({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\gamma\bar{\mathbf{Q}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}=(1+\delta_{Q})(\bar{\mathbf{Q}}^{-1}-\gamma{\mathbf{I}}_{p})\bar{\mathbf{Q}}=(1+\delta_{Q})({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\gamma\bar{\mathbf{Q}})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p10.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p10.3.1" class="ltx_text">which concludes the proof.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>RMT Analysis of the fine-tuned classifier</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Let <math id="A2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{x}}\sim{\mathcal{N}}((-1)^{a}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta},{\mathbf{I}}_{p})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>a</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{x}}\sim{\mathcal{N}}((-1)^{a}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta},{\mathbf{I}}_{p})</annotation></semantics></math> independent of the fine-tuning dataset <math id="A2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{X}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐗</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{X}}</annotation></semantics></math>. We recall that:</p>
<table id="A2.EGx39" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex102"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex102.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle{\bm{w}}_{\alpha}={\bm{w}}+\alpha\tilde{\bm{w}}-\frac{\alpha}{n}{\mathbf{Q}}(\gamma){\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}\tilde{\bm{w}}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝒘</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝒘</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒘</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>α</mi><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒘</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle{\bm{w}}_{\alpha}={\bm{w}}+\alpha\tilde{\bm{w}}-\frac{\alpha}{n}{\mathbf{Q}}(\gamma){\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}\tilde{\bm{w}},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.p1.2" class="ltx_p">where:</p>
<table id="A2.EGx40" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex103"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex103.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle{\bm{w}}=\frac{1}{n}{\mathbf{Q}}(\gamma){\mathbf{X}}{\bm{y}},\quad\tilde{\bm{w}}=\frac{1}{N}{\mathbf{R}}(\tilde{\gamma})\tilde{\mathbf{X}}\tilde{\bm{y}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝒘</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐗</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝒚</mi></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒘</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐑</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐗</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒚</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle{\bm{w}}=\frac{1}{n}{\mathbf{Q}}(\gamma){\mathbf{X}}{\bm{y}},\quad\tilde{\bm{w}}=\frac{1}{N}{\mathbf{R}}(\tilde{\gamma})\tilde{\mathbf{X}}\tilde{\bm{y}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<section id="A2.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.1 </span>Test Expectation</h3>

<div id="A2.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We have that:</p>
<table id="A2.EGx41" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.E13"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\E[{\bm{w}}_{\alpha}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]=\E[{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]+\alpha\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]-\frac{\alpha}{n}\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>α</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>α</mi><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\E[{\bm{w}}_{\alpha}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]=\E[{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]+\alpha\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]-\frac{\alpha}{n}\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(13)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS1.p1.2" class="ltx_p">Let us compute each term of this previous sum.
<br class="ltx_break">First, using lemma <a href="#A1.Thmtheorem6" title="Lemma A.6 (Expectation some classifiers). ‣ A.2 Deterministic equivalents ‣ Appendix A Useful results ‣ 𝛼-LoRA: Effective Fine-Tuning via Base Model Rescaling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.6</span></a>, we have that, since <math id="A2.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{x}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝒙</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{x}}</annotation></semantics></math> is independent of <math id="A2.SS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{X}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐗</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{X}}</annotation></semantics></math> and of <math id="A2.SS1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{\mathbf{X}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐗</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{\mathbf{X}}</annotation></semantics></math>:</p>
<table id="A2.EGx42" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex104"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex104.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\E[{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]=\E[{\bm{w}}]^{\top}\E[{\bm{x}}]=\frac{(-1)^{a}}{1+\delta_{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝐰</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>a</mi></msup><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\E[{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]=\E[{\bm{w}}]^{\top}\E[{\bm{x}}]=\frac{(-1)^{a}}{1+\delta_{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex105"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex105.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]=\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}]^{\top}\E[{\bm{x}}]=\frac{(-1)^{a}}{1+\delta_{R}}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>a</mi></msup><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]=\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}]^{\top}\E[{\bm{x}}]=\frac{(-1)^{a}}{1+\delta_{R}}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS1.p1.3" class="ltx_p">And we have that:</p>
<table id="A2.EGx43" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex106"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex106.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex106.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}]^{\top}\E[{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}]\E[{\bm{x}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}]^{\top}\E[{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}]\E[{\bm{x}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS1.p1.4" class="ltx_p">And:</p>
<table id="A2.EGx44" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex107"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex107.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\E[{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\E[{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex107.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sum_{i=1}^{n}\E[{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sum_{i=1}^{n}\E[{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex108"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex108.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sum_{i=1}^{n}\frac{1}{1+\delta_{Q}}\E[{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}_{i}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sum_{i=1}^{n}\frac{1}{1+\delta_{Q}}\E[{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}_{i}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex109"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex109.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sum_{i=1}^{n}\frac{1}{1+\delta_{Q}}\E[{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}]\bar{\mathbf{Q}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sum_{i=1}^{n}\frac{1}{1+\delta_{Q}}\E[{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}]\bar{\mathbf{Q}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex110"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex110.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{n}{1+\delta_{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{n}{1+\delta_{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS1.p1.5" class="ltx_p">Thus:</p>
<table id="A2.EGx45" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex111"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex111.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{1}{n}\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{1}{n}\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex111.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{(-1)^{a}}{(1+\delta_{R})}\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{Q})}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>a</mi></msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{(-1)^{a}}{(1+\delta_{R})}\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{Q})}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex112"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex112.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{(-1)^{a}}{1+\delta_{R}}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\gamma\bar{\mathbf{Q}}){\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>a</mi></msup><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{(-1)^{a}}{1+\delta_{R}}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\gamma\bar{\mathbf{Q}}){\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS1.p1.6" class="ltx_p">Finally:</p>
<table id="A2.EGx46" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex113"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex113.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\E[{\bm{w}}_{\alpha}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>α</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\E[{\bm{w}}_{\alpha}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex113.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=(-1)^{a}\left(\frac{1}{1+\delta_{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}+\frac{\alpha}{1+\delta_{R}}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}-\frac{\alpha}{1+\delta_{R}}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\gamma\bar{\mathbf{Q}}){\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>a</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>α</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>α</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=(-1)^{a}\left(\frac{1}{1+\delta_{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}+\frac{\alpha}{1+\delta_{R}}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}-\frac{\alpha}{1+\delta_{R}}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\gamma\bar{\mathbf{Q}}){\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex114"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex114.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=(-1)^{a}\left(\frac{1}{1+\delta_{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}+\frac{\alpha\gamma}{1+\delta_{R}}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>a</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=(-1)^{a}\left(\frac{1}{1+\delta_{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}+\frac{\alpha\gamma}{1+\delta_{R}}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">And using the identities in lemma <a href="#A1.Thmtheorem5" title="Lemma A.5 (Relevant Identities). ‣ A.2 Deterministic equivalents ‣ Appendix A Useful results ‣ 𝛼-LoRA: Effective Fine-Tuning via Base Model Rescaling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.5</span></a>:</p>
<table id="A2.EGx47" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.E14"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\E[{\bm{w}}_{\alpha}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>α</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\E[{\bm{w}}_{\alpha}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E14.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{(-1)^{a}}{(\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q}))}\left(\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+\frac{\alpha\gamma(1+\delta_{Q})}{(\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}+1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R}))}\beta\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>a</mi></msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{(-1)^{a}}{(\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q}))}\left(\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+\frac{\alpha\gamma(1+\delta_{Q})}{(\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}+1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R}))}\beta\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(14)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.E15"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{(-1)^{a}}{\lambda_{Q}}\left(\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+\frac{\alpha\beta\gamma(1+\delta_{Q})}{\lambda_{R}}\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>a</mi></msup><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{(-1)^{a}}{\lambda_{Q}}\left(\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+\frac{\alpha\beta\gamma(1+\delta_{Q})}{\lambda_{R}}\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(15)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.2 </span>Test Variance</h3>

<div id="A2.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To compute the variance of <math id="A2.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{w}}_{\alpha}^{\top}{\bm{x}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝒘</mi><mi>α</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝒙</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{w}}_{\alpha}^{\top}{\bm{x}}</annotation></semantics></math>, it suffices to compute the second moment: <math id="A2.SS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\E[({\bm{w}}_{\alpha}^{\top}{\bm{x}})^{2}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>α</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\E[({\bm{w}}_{\alpha}^{\top}{\bm{x}})^{2}]</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
<table id="A2.EGx48" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.E16"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\E[({\bm{w}}_{\alpha}^{\top}{\bm{x}})^{2}]=\E[({\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}+\alpha\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}})^{2}+\frac{\alpha^{2}}{n^{2}}(\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}})^{2}-\frac{2\alpha}{n}\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}({\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}+\alpha\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}})]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><mi>α</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\E[({\bm{w}}_{\alpha}^{\top}{\bm{x}})^{2}]=\E[({\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}+\alpha\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}})^{2}+\frac{\alpha^{2}}{n^{2}}(\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}})^{2}-\frac{2\alpha}{n}\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}({\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}+\alpha\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}})]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(16)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<section id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">First term:</h4>

<div id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We have that, as proved in <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib7" title="" class="ltx_ref">Firdoussi &amp; Seddik (2024)</a></cite>:</p>
<table id="A2.EGx49" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex115"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex115.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\E[({\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}})^{2}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\E[({\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}})^{2}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex115.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{h(1+\delta_{Q})}\left(\frac{1}{1+\delta_{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}-2(1-h){\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\right)+\frac{1-h}{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mi>h</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{h(1+\delta_{Q})}\left(\frac{1}{1+\delta_{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}-2(1-h){\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\right)+\frac{1-h}{h}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex116"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex116.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{h(1+\delta_{Q})}\left(\frac{1}{1+\delta_{Q}}\left(({\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta})^{2}+{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}^{2}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\right)-2(1-h){\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\right)+\frac{1-h}{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mi>h</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{h(1+\delta_{Q})}\left(\frac{1}{1+\delta_{Q}}\left(({\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta})^{2}+{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}^{2}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\right)-2(1-h){\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\right)+\frac{1-h}{h}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex117"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex117.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}}{h(\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q}))}\left(\frac{\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1}{\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q})}-2(1-h)\right)+\frac{1-h}{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mi>h</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}}{h(\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q}))}\left(\frac{\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1}{\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q})}-2(1-h)\right)+\frac{1-h}{h}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">And:</p>
<table id="A2.EGx50" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex118"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex118.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\E[(\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}x)^{2}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\E[(\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}x)^{2}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex118.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex119"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex119.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}{\bm{x}}^{\top}\tilde{\bm{w}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐱𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}{\bm{x}}^{\top}\tilde{\bm{w}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex120"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex120.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}\Sigma_{\beta}\tilde{\bm{w}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}\Sigma_{\beta}\tilde{\bm{w}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p2.2" class="ltx_p">Therefore by lemma <a href="#A1.Thmtheorem8" title="Lemma A.8 (Expectation of 𝒘̃^⊤⁢𝐀⁢𝒘̃). ‣ A.2 Deterministic equivalents ‣ Appendix A Useful results ‣ 𝛼-LoRA: Effective Fine-Tuning via Base Model Rescaling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.8</span></a>:</p>
<table id="A2.E17" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.E17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\E[(\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}x)^{2}]=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}\left({\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\E[{\mathbf{R}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{R}}]{\bm{\mu}}-\frac{2}{(1+\delta_{R})}\frac{1}{N}\Tr(\Sigma\E[{\mathbf{R}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{R}}]){\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}+\frac{1}{N}\Tr(\Sigma\E[{\mathbf{R}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{R}}])\right)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐑</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐑</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐑</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐑</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐑</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐑</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\E[(\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}x)^{2}]=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}\left({\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\E[{\mathbf{R}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{R}}]{\bm{\mu}}-\frac{2}{(1+\delta_{R})}\frac{1}{N}\Tr(\Sigma\E[{\mathbf{R}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{R}}]){\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}+\frac{1}{N}\Tr(\Sigma\E[{\mathbf{R}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{R}}])\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(17)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p2.3" class="ltx_p">And, we have that:</p>
<table id="A2.EGx51" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex121"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex121.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\E[{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\E[{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex121.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\E[{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}{\bm{x}}^{\top}\tilde{\bm{w}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐱𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\E[{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}{\bm{x}}^{\top}\tilde{\bm{w}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex122"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex122.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\E[{\bm{w}}]^{\top}\Sigma_{\beta}\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝐰</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\E[{\bm{w}}]^{\top}\Sigma_{\beta}\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex123"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex123.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{Q})(1+\delta_{R})}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{Q})(1+\delta_{R})}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex124"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex124.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{R})}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\gamma\bar{\mathbf{Q}})\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{R})}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\gamma\bar{\mathbf{Q}})\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex125"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex125.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{R})}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}-\frac{\gamma}{(1+\delta_{R})}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{R})}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}-\frac{\gamma}{(1+\delta_{R})}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p2.4" class="ltx_p">And since <math id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\E[{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]=\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐱𝐰</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\E[{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]=\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]</annotation></semantics></math>, then:</p>
<table id="A2.Ex126" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex126.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\E[{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{R})}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}-\frac{\gamma}{(1+\delta_{R})}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\E[{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{R})}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}-\frac{\gamma}{(1+\delta_{R})}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p2.5" class="ltx_p">and thus:</p>
<table id="A2.E18" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.E18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}={\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}={\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(18)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Second term:</h4>

<div id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Now let us compute the expectation of the second term in equation <a href="#A3.E28" title="In C.2 Test variance ‣ Appendix C RMT Analysis of the fine-tuned classifier: the case of random source vector ‣ 𝛼-LoRA: Effective Fine-Tuning via Base Model Rescaling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">28</span></a>:</p>
<table id="A2.EGx52" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex127"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex127.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{1}{n^{2}}\E[(\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}})^{2}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{1}{n^{2}}\E[(\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}})^{2}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex127.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{n^{2}}\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{n^{2}}\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex128"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex128.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{n^{2}}\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}{\bm{x}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}\tilde{\bm{w}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐱𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{n^{2}}\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}{\bm{x}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}\tilde{\bm{w}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex129"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex129.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{n^{2}}\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}\tilde{\bm{w}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{n^{2}}\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}\tilde{\bm{w}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex130"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex130.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\gamma{\mathbf{Q}})\Sigma_{\beta}({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\gamma{\mathbf{Q}})\tilde{\bm{w}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\gamma{\mathbf{Q}})\Sigma_{\beta}({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\gamma{\mathbf{Q}})\tilde{\bm{w}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.2" class="ltx_p">Therefore, by lemma <a href="#A1.Thmtheorem8" title="Lemma A.8 (Expectation of 𝒘̃^⊤⁢𝐀⁢𝒘̃). ‣ A.2 Deterministic equivalents ‣ Appendix A Useful results ‣ 𝛼-LoRA: Effective Fine-Tuning via Base Model Rescaling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.8</span></a>:</p>
<table id="A2.EGx53" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex131"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex131.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{1}{n^{2}}\E[(\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}})^{2}]=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\E[{\mathbf{R}}({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\gamma{\mathbf{Q}})\Sigma_{\beta}({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\gamma{\mathbf{Q}}){\mathbf{R}}]{\bm{\mu}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐑</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{1}{n^{2}}\E[(\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}})^{2}]=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\E[{\mathbf{R}}({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\gamma{\mathbf{Q}})\Sigma_{\beta}({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\gamma{\mathbf{Q}}){\mathbf{R}}]{\bm{\mu}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex132"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex132.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle+\frac{\Tr(\Sigma\E[{\mathbf{R}}({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\gamma{\mathbf{Q}})\Sigma_{\beta}({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\gamma{\mathbf{Q}}){\mathbf{R}}])}{N(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}\left(1-\frac{2}{(1+\delta_{R})}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐑</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle+\frac{\Tr(\Sigma\E[{\mathbf{R}}({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\gamma{\mathbf{Q}})\Sigma_{\beta}({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\gamma{\mathbf{Q}}){\mathbf{R}}])}{N(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}\left(1-\frac{2}{(1+\delta_{R})}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Third term:</h4>

<div id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Now we want to compute <math id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{2\alpha}{n}\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}({\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}+\alpha\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}})]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{2\alpha}{n}\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}({\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}+\alpha\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}})]</annotation></semantics></math>. So we have that:</p>
<table id="A2.EGx54" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex133"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex133.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐱𝐰</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex133.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}]^{\top}\E[{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}{\bm{x}}^{\top}{\bm{w}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐱𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐰</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}]^{\top}\E[{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}{\bm{x}}^{\top}{\bm{w}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex134"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex134.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}]^{\top}\E[{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\bm{w}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐰</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}]^{\top}\E[{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\bm{w}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex135"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex135.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}]^{\top}\E[\frac{1}{n}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{X}}{\bm{y}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐𝐗</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐲</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}]^{\top}\E[\frac{1}{n}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{X}}{\bm{y}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex136"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex136.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}]^{\top}\E[({\mathbf{Q}}^{-1}-\gamma{\mathbf{I}}_{p}){\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{X}}{\bm{y}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐𝐗</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐲</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}]^{\top}\E[({\mathbf{Q}}^{-1}-\gamma{\mathbf{I}}_{p}){\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{X}}{\bm{y}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex137"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex137.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}]^{\top}\E[({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\gamma{\mathbf{Q}})\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{X}}{\bm{y}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐𝐗</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐲</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}]^{\top}\E[({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\gamma{\mathbf{Q}})\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{X}}{\bm{y}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex138"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex138.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}]^{\top}\left(\E[\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{X}}{\bm{y}}]-\gamma\E[{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{X}}{\bm{y}}]\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐𝐗</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐲</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐𝐗</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐲</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}]^{\top}\left(\E[\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{X}}{\bm{y}}]-\gamma\E[{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{X}}{\bm{y}}]\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.2" class="ltx_p">And we have that:</p>
<table id="A2.EGx55" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex139"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex139.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\E[\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{X}}{\bm{y}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐𝐗</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐲</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\E[\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{X}}{\bm{y}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex139.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sum_{i=1}^{n}\E[y_{i}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}_{i}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sum_{i=1}^{n}\E[y_{i}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}_{i}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex140"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex140.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{n}{(1+\delta_{Q})}\E[y_{i}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{n}{(1+\delta_{Q})}\E[y_{i}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex141"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex141.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{n}{(1+\delta_{Q})}\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{n}{(1+\delta_{Q})}\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex142"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex142.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=n({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\gamma\bar{\mathbf{Q}}){\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=n({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\gamma\bar{\mathbf{Q}}){\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.3" class="ltx_p">And:</p>
<table id="A2.EGx56" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex143"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex143.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\E[{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{X}}{\bm{y}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐𝐗</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐲</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\E[{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{X}}{\bm{y}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex143.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sum_{i=1}^{n}\E[y_{i}{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}_{i}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sum_{i=1}^{n}\E[y_{i}{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}_{i}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex144"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex144.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{n}{(1+\delta_{Q})}\E[y_{i}{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{n}{(1+\delta_{Q})}\E[y_{i}{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex145"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex145.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{n}{(1+\delta_{Q})}\E\left[y_{i}\left({\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}-\frac{\frac{1}{n}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}}{1+\delta_{Q}}\right)\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{n}{(1+\delta_{Q})}\E\left[y_{i}\left({\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}-\frac{\frac{1}{n}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}}{1+\delta_{Q}}\right)\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex146"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex146.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{n}{(1+\delta_{Q})}\left(\E[y_{i}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}]-\frac{1}{n(1+\delta_{Q})}\E[y_{i}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}]\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{n}{(1+\delta_{Q})}\left(\E[y_{i}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}]-\frac{1}{n(1+\delta_{Q})}\E[y_{i}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}{\bm{x}}_{i}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}_{-i}{\bm{x}}_{i}]\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex147"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex147.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{n}{(1+\delta_{Q})}\left(\E[{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}]{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}-\frac{1}{n(1+\delta_{Q})}\Tr(\Sigma_{\beta}\E[{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}])\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{n}{(1+\delta_{Q})}\left(\E[{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}]{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}-\frac{1}{n(1+\delta_{Q})}\Tr(\Sigma_{\beta}\E[{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}])\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex148"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex148.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{n}{h(1+\delta_{Q})}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}-\frac{n(1-h)}{h}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mi>h</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{n}{h(1+\delta_{Q})}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}-\frac{n(1-h)}{h}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex149"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex149.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=n\left(\frac{1}{h}({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\gamma\bar{\mathbf{Q}})\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}-\frac{1-h}{h}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>h</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mi>h</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=n\left(\frac{1}{h}({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\gamma\bar{\mathbf{Q}})\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}-\frac{1-h}{h}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex150"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex150.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=n(\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}-\frac{\gamma}{h}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}^{2}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>γ</mi><mi>h</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=n(\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}-\frac{\gamma}{h}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}^{2}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.4" class="ltx_p">Thus:</p>
<table id="A2.E19" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.E19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{1}{n}\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{R})}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}\left({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-2\gamma\bar{\mathbf{Q}}+\frac{\gamma^{2}}{h}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}^{2}\right){\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐱𝐰</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>γ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>h</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{1}{n}\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{R})}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}\left({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-2\gamma\bar{\mathbf{Q}}+\frac{\gamma^{2}}{h}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}^{2}\right){\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(19)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.5" class="ltx_p">Let us now compute the remaining term:</p>
<table id="A2.EGx57" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex151"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex151.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{1}{n}\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{1}{n}\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex151.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{n}\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}{\bm{x}}^{\top}\tilde{\bm{w}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐱𝐱</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{n}\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}{\bm{x}}^{\top}\tilde{\bm{w}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex152"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex152.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{n}\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}\tilde{\bm{w}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{n}\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}\tilde{\bm{w}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex153"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex153.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\gamma{\mathbf{Q}})\Sigma_{\beta}\tilde{\bm{w}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\gamma{\mathbf{Q}})\Sigma_{\beta}\tilde{\bm{w}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.6" class="ltx_p">And again by lemma <a href="#A1.Thmtheorem8" title="Lemma A.8 (Expectation of 𝒘̃^⊤⁢𝐀⁢𝒘̃). ‣ A.2 Deterministic equivalents ‣ Appendix A Useful results ‣ 𝛼-LoRA: Effective Fine-Tuning via Base Model Rescaling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.8</span></a>:</p>
<table id="A2.EGx58" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex154"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex154.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{1}{n}\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\E[{\mathbf{R}}({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\gamma{\mathbf{Q}})\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{R}}]{\bm{\mu}}+\frac{\Tr(\Sigma\E[{\mathbf{R}}({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\gamma{\mathbf{Q}})\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{R}}])}{N(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}\left(1-\frac{2}{(1+\delta_{R})}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐑</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐑</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{1}{n}\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]=\frac{1}{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\E[{\mathbf{R}}({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\gamma{\mathbf{Q}})\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{R}}]{\bm{\mu}}+\frac{\Tr(\Sigma\E[{\mathbf{R}}({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\gamma{\mathbf{Q}})\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{R}}])}{N(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}\left(1-\frac{2}{(1+\delta_{R})}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Now let us group all the results as follows.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px4" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Terms without <math id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math>:</h4>

<div id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">There is only one term which is:</p>
<table id="A2.EGx59" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex155"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex155.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle T_{1}=\E[({\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}})^{2}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle T_{1}=\E[({\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}})^{2}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex155.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{h(1+\delta_{Q})}\left((2h-1){\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}-\gamma{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}^{2}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\right)+\frac{1-h}{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mi>h</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{h(1+\delta_{Q})}\left((2h-1){\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}-\gamma{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}^{2}{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\right)+\frac{1-h}{h}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex156"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex156.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}}{h(\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q}))}\left(\frac{\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1}{\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q})}-2(1-h)\right)+\frac{1-h}{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mi>h</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}}{h(\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q}))}\left(\frac{\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1}{\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q})}-2(1-h)\right)+\frac{1-h}{h}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px5" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Terms in <math id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math>:</h4>

<div id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">There are two: <math id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px5.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2\E[{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2\E[{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px5.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{2}{n}\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐱𝐰</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{2}{n}\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]</annotation></semantics></math>:</p>
<table id="A2.EGx60" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex157"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex157.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle T_{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle T_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex157.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=2\E[{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]-\frac{2}{n}\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐱𝐰</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=2\E[{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]-\frac{2}{n}\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex158"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex158.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{2}{(1+\delta_{R})}\left({\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}-\gamma{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}-{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-2\gamma\bar{\mathbf{Q}}+\frac{\gamma^{2}}{h}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}^{2}){\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>γ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>h</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{2}{(1+\delta_{R})}\left({\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}-\gamma{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{\mu}}-{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-2\gamma\bar{\mathbf{Q}}+\frac{\gamma^{2}}{h}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}^{2}){\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex159"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex159.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{2\gamma}{(1+\delta_{R})}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}\left({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\frac{\gamma}{h}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}\right){\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>γ</mi><mi>h</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{2\gamma}{(1+\delta_{R})}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}\left({\mathbf{I}}_{p}-\frac{\gamma}{h}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}\right){\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px5.p1.2" class="ltx_p">And using lemma <a href="#A1.Thmtheorem5" title="Lemma A.5 (Relevant Identities). ‣ A.2 Deterministic equivalents ‣ Appendix A Useful results ‣ 𝛼-LoRA: Effective Fine-Tuning via Base Model Rescaling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.5</span></a>:</p>
<table id="A2.Ex160" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex160.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{2}=\frac{2\gamma(1+\delta_{Q})\beta\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}}{\left(\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}+1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R})\right)(\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q}))}\left(1-\frac{\gamma(1+\delta_{Q})}{h(\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q}))}\right)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>γ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝝁</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{2}=\frac{2\gamma(1+\delta_{Q})\beta\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}}{\left(\|{\bm{\mu}}\|^{2}+1+\tilde{\gamma}(1+\delta_{R})\right)(\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q}))}\left(1-\frac{\gamma(1+\delta_{Q})}{h(\|{\bm{\mu}}_{\beta}\|^{2}+1+\gamma(1+\delta_{Q}))}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px6" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Terms in <math id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></h4>

<div id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px6.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">: we have three terms: <math id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px6.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\E[(\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}})^{2}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\E[(\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}})^{2}]</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px6.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{1}{n^{2}}\E[(\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}})^{2}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{1}{n^{2}}\E[(\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}})^{2}]</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px6.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{-2}{n}\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{-2}{n}\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]</annotation></semantics></math>:</p>
<table id="A2.EGx61" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex161"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex161.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle T_{3}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle T_{3}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex161.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\E[(\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}})^{2}]+\frac{1}{n^{2}}\E[(\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}})^{2}]-\frac{2}{n}\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐗𝐗</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\E[(\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}})^{2}]+\frac{1}{n^{2}}\E[(\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}})^{2}]-\frac{2}{n}\E[\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\mathbf{X}}{\mathbf{X}}^{\top}{\mathbf{Q}}{\bm{x}}\tilde{\bm{w}}^{\top}{\bm{x}}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex162"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex162.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{\gamma}{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\left(\E[{\mathbf{R}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{R}}]-\E[{\mathbf{R}}\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{R}}]+\gamma\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{R}}]\right){\bm{\mu}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>γ</mi><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐑</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐑</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐑</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐑</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐑𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐𝐑</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{\gamma}{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\left(\E[{\mathbf{R}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{R}}]-\E[{\mathbf{R}}\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{R}}]+\gamma\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{R}}]\right){\bm{\mu}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex163"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex163.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle+\frac{\gamma}{N(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}\left(1-\frac{2}{(1+\delta_{R})}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}\right)\Tr\left(\Sigma(\E[{\mathbf{R}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{R}}]-\E[{\mathbf{R}}\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{R}}]+\gamma\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{R}}])\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐑</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐑</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐑</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐑</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐑𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐𝐑</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle+\frac{\gamma}{N(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}\left(1-\frac{2}{(1+\delta_{R})}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}\right)\Tr\left(\Sigma(\E[{\mathbf{R}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{R}}]-\E[{\mathbf{R}}\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{R}}]+\gamma\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{R}}])\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex164"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex164.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{\gamma^{2}}{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}\left[{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{R}}]{\bm{\mu}}+\left(1-\frac{2}{(1+\delta_{R})}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}\right)\frac{1}{N}\Tr(\Sigma\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{R}}])\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>γ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐑𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐𝐑</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐑𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐𝐑</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{\gamma^{2}}{(1+\delta_{R})^{2}}\left[{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{R}}]{\bm{\mu}}+\left(1-\frac{2}{(1+\delta_{R})}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\bar{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}\right)\frac{1}{N}\Tr(\Sigma\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{R}}])\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px6.p1.2" class="ltx_p">where the last equality is gotten using lemma <a href="#A1.Thmtheorem9" title="Lemma A.9 (Commutativity). ‣ A.2 Deterministic equivalents ‣ Appendix A Useful results ‣ 𝛼-LoRA: Effective Fine-Tuning via Base Model Rescaling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.9</span></a>.
<br class="ltx_break">We also have that:</p>
<table id="A2.EGx62" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex165"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex165.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{1}{N}\Tr(\Sigma\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{R}}])" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐑𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐𝐑</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{1}{N}\Tr(\Sigma\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{R}}])</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex165.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{N}\Tr(\E[\Sigma{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{R}}])" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐑𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐𝐑</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{N}\Tr(\E[\Sigma{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{R}}])</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex166"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex166.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{N}\E[\Tr(\Sigma{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{R}})]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐑𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐𝐑</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{N}\E[\Tr(\Sigma{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{R}})]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex167"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex167.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{N}\E[\Tr({\mathbf{R}}\Sigma{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}})]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐑</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐑𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{N}\E[\Tr({\mathbf{R}}\Sigma{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}})]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex168"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex168.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{N}\Tr(\E[{\mathbf{R}}\Sigma{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}])" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐑</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐑𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{N}\Tr(\E[{\mathbf{R}}\Sigma{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}])</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex169"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex169.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{N}\Tr(\E[{\mathbf{R}}\Sigma{\mathbf{R}}]\E[{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}])" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐑</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐑</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{N}\Tr(\E[{\mathbf{R}}\Sigma{\mathbf{R}}]\E[{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}])</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex170"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex170.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{h\tilde{h}}\frac{1}{N}\Tr(\bar{\mathbf{R}}\Sigma\bar{\mathbf{R}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{Q}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>h</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐑</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐐</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{h\tilde{h}}\frac{1}{N}\Tr(\bar{\mathbf{R}}\Sigma\bar{\mathbf{R}}\bar{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}\bar{\mathbf{Q}})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS0.Px6.p1.3" class="ltx_p">And:</p>
<table id="A2.EGx63" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex171"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex171.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{R}}]{\bm{\mu}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐑𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐𝐑</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{R}}]{\bm{\mu}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex171.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\Tr(\E[{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}])" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐑𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐𝐑</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\Tr(\E[{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}])</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex172"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex172.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\E[\Tr({\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}})]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐑</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐑𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\E[\Tr({\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}{\mathbf{R}}{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}})]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex173"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex173.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\Tr(\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}{\mathbf{R}}]\E[{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}])" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐑</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝝁</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝝁</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐑</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐐</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐐</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\Tr(\E[{\mathbf{R}}{\bm{\mu}}{\bm{\mu}}^{\top}{\mathbf{R}}]\E[{\mathbf{Q}}\Sigma_{\beta}{\mathbf{Q}}])</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
