<section id="A5.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.2 </span>Values of <math id="A5.SS2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></h3>

<div id="A5.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We report in the following plots some metrics (mean, standard deviation, percentiles) describing the obtained values of the vectors <math id="A5.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{\alpha}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝜶</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{\alpha}</annotation></semantics></math> for each module after the training phase.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A5.F7" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2510.21345v1/alpha_statistics_mnli.svg" id="A5.F7.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:548/220;" width="548" height="220"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 7: </span>Statistics of the vectors <math id="A5.F7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{\alpha}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝜶</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{\alpha}</annotation></semantics></math> for the MNLI benchmark</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A5.F8" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2510.21345v1/alpha_statistics_qnli.svg" id="A5.F8.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:548/220;" width="548" height="220"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 8: </span>Statistics of the vectors <math id="A5.F8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{\alpha}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝜶</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{\alpha}</annotation></semantics></math> for the QNLI benchmark</figcaption>
</figure>
